# =============================================================================
# NFTBan v0.7.3 - Runtime Table (DEPRECATED)
# =============================================================================
#
# ⚠️  DEPRECATED in v0.7.3 unified architecture
#
# In v0.7.3, all runtime sets (temp_whitelist, blacklist with timeout) are
# managed in the main tables (ip nftban / ip6 nftban), not separate runtime table.
#
# This file is kept for backwards compatibility and migration purposes only.
# New deployments should use the unified architecture in nftables.conf.
#
# Migration path:
# 1. Old: inet nftban_runtime with separate temp_ban/temp_whitelist sets
# 2. New: ip/ip6 nftban with unified blacklist + temp_whitelist in main tables
#
# To migrate:
#   nftban sync    # Loads unified architecture from nftables.conf
# =============================================================================

# No operations - unified architecture handles all runtime state in main tables
# See: install/nftables/nftables.conf for v0.7.3 unified architecture
